flowchart TD
DV["**Decision Variables**<br/>Buffer capacities for each buffer<br/>Type integer {1-10} per variable"]
NSGA2["**NSGA2 Optimizer**<br/>Population based multi objective search<br/>Controls generations and operators"]
Problem["**BufferCapacityProblem**<br/>Attributes base_seed and n_cores<br/>Elementwise evaluator linked to optimizer<br/>Method _evaluate fills out F for population"]
Pool["**Multiprocessing Pool**<br/>Parallel workers equal to n_cores<br/>Maps individuals to evaluator workers"]
Evaluator["**Evaluator Worker**<br/>evaluate_single_individual function<br/>Inputs caps and seed<br/>Returns objectives [wip, -throughput]"]
RunCaps["**run_simulation_with_caps**<br/>Applies caps to global buffers<br/>Runs REPLICATIONS replications and aggregates KPIs"]
GlobalBuffers["**Global BUFFERS**<br/>Capacities stored here and modified by optimizer<br/>Names: PostLoading PostConveyor PostWashing PrePress1 PrePress2 PostPresses"]
RunRep["**run_replication**<br/>Creates simpy environment and entities<br/>Runs one simulation replication<br/>Returns throughput mean_wip energy_per_part"]
SimModel["**Simulation Model**<br/>Classes Machine and Buffer<br/>Key methods: process_part put get process_item<br/>Tracks energy and sojourn times"]
Objectives["**Objectives**<br/>f1 average WIP to minimize<br/>f2 negative throughput to minimize thus maximize throughput"]
Results["**Result Collector**<br/>Collects out F and history from optimizer<br/>Provides final Pareto set and metrics"]
Export["**Export History**<br/>Writes CSV of generations individuals caps wip throughput<br/>Consumes optimization history"]

DV --> NSGA2
NSGA2 --> Problem
Problem --> Pool
Pool --> Evaluator
Evaluator --> RunCaps
RunCaps --> GlobalBuffers
RunCaps --> RunRep
RunRep --> SimModel
SimModel --> RunRep
RunRep --> RunCaps
RunCaps --> Evaluator
Evaluator --> Pool
Pool --> Problem
Problem --> NSGA2
NSGA2 --> Results
Results --> Export